      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The reason people disagree with you is exactly why they are hiding the ranks that exist above trusted to this day. There was so much backlash during the open beta regarding things such as how the ranks were calculated and how ranks themselves are a horrible idea in any social application. Being able to instantly visually judge a user drastically changed the social interaction of the game in both many positive and negative ways.\nIm interested to see if they are brave enough to do something within the next UI update, but until then it would be unwise to just revert the changes.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
