  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I know that was closed in 2018 but now we in 2020 it's really nice to see changes  \nI know its not easy work but it's worth it!  \nwhy put it back? \nwe need a special rank that we can change our Color Rank but not like the photo And can put any back image in our profile and can put links in Sate for discord or YouTube.  \nand Can change Rank to Know User and User! \nabout the requirements to get the Rank its for vrchat  \nI Don t care if that will take a long time or months or years please Vr chat team think about it there is a lot of people who make cool Worlds and Avatars and play the game for over 1k h in the game and it's really nice to see new rank!   \nI know some people disagree but I have no idea why I mean we not losing something for it  I know people play the game for thousands of hours but they still Trusted its nice to see that they get More Rank because they played a lot of time!",
